[statement]
As `a-requested-name-with-two-candidates-is-not-settled-first`, with `y>=2`
requested and `p3` providing `y` at 1: the constraint leaves `y` one
candidate, `p2`, which is settled first and provides `x` too.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:x y=2
k:10

P:p3
V:1
p:y=1

[request]
x
y>=2

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1
